49,2,3,talk,Mio,,"The lottery might be fair, but it ignores the daily riders’ preferences.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Misaki,,I’m leaning towards a paid allocation to cover costs and reduce conflict.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shizue,,I worry about the physical difficulty of the racks for some residents.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
